+	<title>{{.Username}}, confirm the deletion of your account</title>
+</head>
+
+<body>
+	<p>Hi <b>{{.Username}}</b>,</p>
+	<p>Please click the following link to delete the account within <b>{{.ActiveCodeLives}} hours</b>:</p>
+	<p><a href="{{AppURL}}user/delete_account/complete?code={{.Code}}">{{AppURL}}user/delete_account/complete?code={{.Code}}</a></p>
+	<p>If you did not ask for this, ignore this message; nothing changes until the link is used.</p>
+	<p>© {{Year}} <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="{{AppURL}}">{{AppName}}</a></p>
+</body>
+</html>
